"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luqin"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045:r0090","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"弟","person_id":"r09_ja4_zzk","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"犯法度，爽深納之，而罰其弟。除尚書郎。爽誅，免官。","note":"依所引原句及對話角色辨識。","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luqin"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045","text":"盧欽，字子若，范陽涿人也。祖植，漢侍中。父毓，魏司空。世以儒業顯。欽清淡有遠識，篤志經史，舉孝廉，不行，魏大將軍曹爽辟為掾。爽弟嘗有所屬請，欽白爽子弟不宜干犯法度，爽深納之，而罰其弟。除尚書郎。爽誅，免官。後為侍御史，襲父爵大利亭侯，累遷琅邪太守。宣帝為太傅，辟從事中郎，出為陽平太守，遷淮北都督、伏波將軍，甚有稱績。徵拜散騎常侍、大司農，遷吏部尚書，進封大梁侯。武帝受禪，以為都督沔北諸軍事、平南將軍、假節，給追鋒軺臥車各一乘、第二駙馬二乘、騎具刀器、禦府人馬鎧等，及錢三十萬。欽在鎮寬猛得中，疆埸無虞。入為尚書僕射，加侍中、奉車都尉，領吏部。以清貧，特賜絹百匹。欽舉必以材，稱為廉平。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"盧欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"子若","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"植","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"毓","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045:m0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"欽","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin:line045:m0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"曹爽","k